url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T03:20:02Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T03:20:02Z","body":"Documentation changes required.\r\n\r\nTry godot --doctool\r\n\r\n```patch\r\ndiff --git a/doc/classes/Image.xml b/doc/classes/Image.xml\r\nindex 97c4bba..138abe0 100644\r\n--- a/doc/classes/Image.xml\r\n+++ b/doc/classes/Image.xml\r\n@@ -346,13 +346,6 @@\r\n \t\t\t\t[b]Note:[/b] This method is only available in engine builds with the BMP module enabled. By default, the BMP module is enabled, but it can be disabled at build-time using the [code]module_bmp_enabled=no[/code] SCons option.\r\n \t\t\t</description>\r\n \t\t</method>\r\n-\t\t<method name=\"load_from_file\" qualifiers=\"static\">\r\n-\t\t\t<return type=\"Image\" />\r\n-\t\t\t<param index=\"0\" name=\"path\" type=\"String\" />\r\n-\t\t\t<description>\r\n-\t\t\t\tCreates a new [Image] and loads data from the specified file.\r\n-\t\t\t</description>\r\n-\t\t</method>\r\n \t\t<method name=\"load_exr_from_buffer\">\r\n \t\t\t<return type=\"int\" enum=\"Error\" />\r\n \t\t\t<param index=\"0\" name=\"buffer\" type=\"PackedByteArray\" />\r\n@@ -361,6 +354,13 @@\r\n \t\t\t\tNote: The TinyEXR module is disabled in non-editor builds, which means load_exr_from_buffer will return an error in exported builds unless it is explicitly enabled at build-time using [code]tinyexr_always=yes[/code] SCons option.\r\n \t\t\t</description>\r\n \t\t</method>\r\n+\t\t<method name=\"load_from_file\" qualifiers=\"static\">\r\n+\t\t\t<return type=\"Image\" />\r\n+\t\t\t<param index=\"0\" name=\"path\" type=\"String\" />\r\n+\t\t\t<description>\r\n+\t\t\t\tCreates a new [Image] and loads data from the specified file.\r\n+\t\t\t</description>\r\n+\t\t</method>\r\n \t\t<method name=\"load_jpg_from_buffer\">\r\n \t\t\t<return type=\"int\" enum=\"Error\" />\r\n \t\t\t<param index=\"0\" name=\"buffer\" type=\"PackedByteArray\" />\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576635546/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2577278732","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101255#issuecomment-2577278732","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101255","id":2577278732,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZnicM","user":{"login":"metamuffin","id":42977997,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTc3OTk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42977997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/metamuffin","html_url":"https://github.com/metamuffin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metamuffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metamuffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metamuffin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metamuffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metamuffin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metamuffin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metamuf